THERE ITS CSS
*{
    margin: 0;
    padding: 0;
    box-sizing: border-box;
    font-family: system-ui, -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, 'Segoe UI', Roboto, Oxygen, Ubuntu, Cantarell, 'Open Sans', 'Helvetica Neue', sans-serif;
}
html,body{
    width: 100%;
    height:100%;
    background-color: rgb(187, 243, 255);
}
 
#main #card{
    position: absolute;
    top: 20%;
    left: 40%;
    width: 400px;
    height: 500px;
    background-color: rgb(245, 244, 244);
    border-radius: 10%;
    padding-top: 30px;
    padding-left: 10px;
}
#card #circle{
    width: 100px;
    height: 100px;
    background-color: beige;
    border-radius: 50%;
    background-image: url("https://wallpapercave.com/wp/wp14679334.jpg");
    background-size: cover;
    
}
#card button{
   width: 150px;
   height: 25px;
   border-radius: 5px;
   border-style: none;
   font-weight: 700;
   background-color:rgb(176, 231, 251);
   margin-top: 2%;
   margin-left: 25%;
}
